New: DoFTools::make_periodicity_constraints_on_level() constructs periodic
constraints for multigrid level degrees of freedom, including transformations
of vector-valued components. An optional argument of MGConstrainedDoFs::initialize()
can skip the default identity periodicity constraints so that such constraints
can be supplied through MGConstrainedDoFs::add_user_constraints(). Existing
initialization calls retain their behavior.
